00:11:02,975 --> 00:11:05,060
That's one way to do it but

283
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:07,575
a more typical way
to do it would be to

284
00:11:07,575 --> 00:11:10,480
place a cdev structure inside

285
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:13,540
your own custom structure
that's used for

286
00:11:13,540 --> 00:11:16,780
your driver and then
just pass a pointer

