00:13:29,845 --> 00:13:33,220
i_cdev, and get a pointer
to my c_dev structure.

339
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:35,920
Let's say I have a pointer
to the c_dev structure and

340
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:37,840
I use this option
where I embedded

341
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,220
this c_dev structure in

342
00:13:39,220 --> 00:13:41,935
my scull_dev structure that

