362
00:14:23,310 --> 00:14:26,740
The container of macro

363
00:14:26,740 --> 00:14:29,275
can take in this case
the inode, i_cdev,

364
00:14:29,275 --> 00:14:31,030
or the pointer to the
cdev so pointer to

365
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:33,100
this particular location and

366
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:34,540
it can take struck scull_dev,

367
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:37,210
so it's the overall
